<span id="xdx_827_zW4pwNgJSd1">ADVANCES ON FUTURE RECEIPTS</span></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></p>

