<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 20pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></p>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><span id="xdx_F0E_z7z3slMeaumk" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">(A)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F14_zgrCOO2aS2fh" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001177" xml:lang="en-US">On
    December 1, 2015, the Company issued a convertible note payable to Mr. Cutaia, the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer and a
    director, to consolidate all loans and advances made by Mr. Cutaia to the Company as of that date. On May 19, 2021, the Company
    amended the note to allow for conversion of the note at any time at the discretion of the holder at a fixed conversion price of
    $<span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_pid_c20210519__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteOneMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_z243nhRqADW" title="Debt instrument convertible conversion price" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2021-05-19_custom_NoteOneMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">41.20</ix:nonFraction></span>,
    which was the closing price of the common stock on the amendment date. On May 12, 2022, the maturity date of the note was extended
    to <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentMaturityDate_dd_c20220511__20220512__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteOneMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zZbILEWi2CHa" title="Maturity date" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2022-05-112022-05-12_custom_NoteOneMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentMaturityDate">April
    1, 2023</ix:nonNumeric></span>. As of June 30, 2023 and December 31, 2022, the outstanding balance under the note was $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--NotesPayable_iI_pn3n3_c20230630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteOneMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zLsuCEACEv96" title="Related party note payable" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayable" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30_custom_NoteOneMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">854</ix:nonFraction></span>
    and $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--NotesPayable_iI_pn3n3_c20221231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteOneMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zSTsph0tVp0d" title="Related party note payable" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayable" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_NoteOneMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">811</ix:nonFraction></span>,
    respectively. As of June 30, 2023 and December 31, 2022, the portion of the outstanding balance that represents accrued interest
was $<span id="xdx_902_ecustom--DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest_pn3n3_c20230101__20230630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteOneMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zdNYEYNxtyMl" title="Accrued interest" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="VERB:DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_custom_NoteOneMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">129</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_907_ecustom--DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest_pn3n3_c20220101__20230630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteOneMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zlECT6xiEiia" title="Accrued interest" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="VERB:DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest" contextRef="From2022-01-012023-06-30_custom_NoteOneMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">86</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><span id="xdx_F06_zHvp3rlBeTVf" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">(B)</span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F10_zgT1gry4QxK" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black"><ix:footnote id="Footnote001190" xml:lang="en-US">On
    April 4, 2016, the Company issued a convertible note payable to Mr. Cutaia, in the amount of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ConvertibleNotesPayable_iI_pn3n3_c20160404__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteTwoMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_z5GWAIfcQbj4" title="Convertible notes payable" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ConvertibleNotesPayable" contextRef="AsOf2016-04-04_custom_NoteTwoMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">343</ix:nonFraction></span>,
    to consolidate all advances made by Mr. Cutaia to the Company during the period December 2015 through March 2016. On May 19, 2021,
    the Company amended the note to allow for conversion of the note at any time at the discretion of the holder at a fixed conversion
    price of $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1_iI_pid_c20210519__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteTwoMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zszvQ4dvkhTh" title="Debt instrument convertible conversion price" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentConvertibleConversionPrice1" contextRef="AsOf2021-05-19_custom_NoteTwoMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">41.20</ix:nonFraction></span>,
    which was the closing price of the common stock on the amendment date. As of June 30, 2023 and December 31, 2022, the outstanding
    balance under the note was $<span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--NotesPayable_iI_pn3n3_c20230630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteTwoMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_z7rhTFPRhAsh" title="Related party note payable" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayable" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30_custom_NoteTwoMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">47</ix:nonFraction></span>
    and $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--NotesPayable_iI_pn3n3_c20221231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteTwoMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zF37H4cFMEsf" title="Related party note payable" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayable" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31_custom_NoteTwoMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">45</ix:nonFraction></span>,
    respectively. As of June 30, 2023 and December 31, 2022, the portion of the outstanding balance that represents accrued interest
was $<span id="xdx_905_ecustom--DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest_pn3n3_c20230101__20230630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteTwoMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zeMSWPnwEMEa" title="Accrued interest" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="VERB:DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest" contextRef="From2023-01-012023-06-30_custom_NoteTwoMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">7</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90E_ecustom--DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest_pn3n3_c20220101__20230630__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--NoteTwoMember__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--Mr.CutaiaMember_zZKvmJYW9hif" title="Accrued interest" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIFNDSEVEVUxFIE9GIE5PVEVTIFBBWUFCTEUgUkVMQVRFRCBQQVJUSUVTIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="VERB:DebtInstrumentAccruedInterest" contextRef="From2022-01-012023-06-30_custom_NoteTwoMember_custom_Mr.CutaiaMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">5</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively.</ix:footnote></span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></p>


