fair value of share option award is estimated using the Black-Scholes option pricing method based on the following weighted-average assumptions:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">&#160;</span></p>

